 ],
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Look closely at a swinging weight, and you will find a *clock* hidden inside it.",
   "gap": 0.7,
   "plan": {
    "in": "ink-on",
    "trans": "light-change",
    "cam": "hold",
    "comp": "room-wide"
   }
  },
  {
   "text": "A young man watched a lamp swing in a cathedral, and something did not *add* up.",
   "gap": 0.7,
   "plan": {
    "in": "drop",
    "trans": "match",
    "cam": "push",
    "comp": "figure-left"
   }
  },
  {
   "text": "Wide swings and small swings seemed to take the *same* time.",
   "gap": 0.7,
   "plan": {
    "in": "grow",
    "trans": "morph",
    "cam": "hold",
    "comp": "lamp-centre"
   },
   "sfx": [
    {
     "at": 0.8,
     "file": "public/sfx/machine_chime_1.wav",
     "db": -20
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "He checked it against the one clock he always carried: his own *pulse*.",
   "gap": 0.7,
   "plan": {
    "in": "stamp",
    "trans": "trace",
    "cam": "push",
    "comp": "close-face"
   }
  },
  {
   "text": "Today we can watch the same thing through an *eyepiece*.",
   "gap": 0.7,
   "plan": {
    "in": "iris",
    "trans": "window",
    "cam": "hold",
    "comp": "eyepiece-right"
   }
  },
  {
   "text": "And on paper, the whole rule fits in a single *line*.",
   "gap": 0.7,
   "plan": {
    "in": "unroll",
    "trans": "real-reveal",
    "cam": "pull",
    "comp": "page-left"
   }
  },
  {
   "text": "A weight on a string had become a way to *measure* time.",
   "gap": 0.7,
   "plan": {
    "in": "quill",
    "trans": "window-close",
    "cam": "pull",
    "comp": "room-wide"
   }
  }
 ],
